==Strategy==
Similarly to the previous stage, it is possible to beat this stage right out of [[Empire of Cats]] with level 20 units. However, this will be much more difficult.

Kill the beginning Ginger Snaches with [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale]] and lure One Horn close to the base, and spam all the attacker units you can, such as [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|True Valkyrie]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon]], and the aforementioned whale. Teacher Bear can be quite the nuisance to deal with, so use your cat cannon to keep him off your stack for as long as possible. When One Horn falls, spawn Bahamut and start meatshielding. By now, Wrestling has likely spawned. Teacher Bear won't be an issue after you kill One Horn, so he's going to be a source of cash for you.

Throughout the battle, keep spamming meatshields and Valkyrie as soon as she comes off cooldown. The H. Nahs will make your life miserable by constantly removing your meatshield layer, giving Wrestling an opening to reach your Valkyrie. However, if you meatshield well, she'll never reach your dragons or Bahamut. The H. Nahs pushing can help bring them into Bahamut's range, taking huge damage. You will likely run low on cash, and you can bring a Rich Cat if you're worried about it. However, you can just conserve cash until each Celeboodle spawn. Just remember to keep an eye on your front lines and your money and you'll be set.

